      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/granger_iowa",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "From the early 1900s through the mid‑20th century, Granger hosted the Yankee Robinson Circus each winter, where locals watched animals and performers load onto trains.",
